{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/dm61tcqph6xt83mrovocb9g7029s481.mp3","text":"汪汪，嗷！（虎狼丸看起来很有精神，似乎可以放心把工作交给他。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/nhs5g9wxd2sikibwoe24800iil1rygs.mp3","text":"汪嗷！（虎狼丸叼来了一个弹力球，但上面有医务室的徽记。是他捡到的吗……）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/48/pwur02mukaz1u5lx30tic8p9wlaqbot.mp3","text":"汪汪！（虎狼丸叼来了蜜饼，似乎是想分享这份食物。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/dejw41d3eojzv0p417tscoyx6ovc3f3.mp3","text":"汪呜……汪，汪呜……！（虽然天气不太好，但虎狼丸在望着窗外吠叫。看来就算是这种天气，他也想去散步啊……）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_004.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/50sg9uedg2jcg9lbnhzxapx2g78pmi3.mp3","text":"汪……？汪汪，汪，汪？（虎狼丸似乎对置物架上的棋盘很感兴趣。下一次下棋时，要不要请虎狼丸来观战呢……）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/6fktsdeyk0ep5uguow2moira6a8jnr5.mp3","text":"汪嗷……汪！呼呼。（按照指示，虎狼丸叼来了一盒泡面，看来阿米娅没有发现。刚好热水也烧好了。摸摸虎狼丸的头，表扬他吧。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/h1mf6n1rg4h261e8msjk6a0ksfv4ms0.mp3","text":"汪！汪……？汪汪。（虎狼丸守在办公室门口。出门时，他似乎想要一起走，示意他回到门口，虎狼丸就乖乖地坐下了。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/3ry8nl5rk96f7nf4m9fv3pqvrk90gdi.mp3","text":"呜……（虎狼丸用头顶了顶你，然后在你身边安静地卧了下来。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/8zjai49zw545s8tw5ta8p6b9nze0p6y.mp3","text":"汪！（虎狼丸伸出了前爪，似乎想要握手。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/djz9rltzx3isibqoxugxruao9et7z4a.mp3","text":"汪……？汪嗷，汪！（虎狼丸很高兴，看来他很想一起看电视……？）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_012.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/kv6brnbz2qsp4mx165m13o85aarwq6m.mp3","text":"汪，汪，汪汪！（虎狼丸对同伴们轻轻叫着，像是在打招呼一样。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/f2gol8bar5966fbo7oy5xy9jvu6yr3c.mp3","text":"汪汪！（虎狼丸非常兴奋，请队员们留意跟上虎狼丸的速度。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/6pqlt7u6l47mls8vtfxr2gpe038wt8g.mp3","text":"汪！（虎狼丸似乎想要确认目的地。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/3iz9dowf6vhcopd3o0sps5ud5nn12ai.mp3","text":"汪呜……汪汪汪！（虎狼丸冲了出去！）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/4z0j3ttpyuoqkiw80tc6br3dzfr56dz.mp3","text":"汪呜？（虎狼丸似乎在思考……）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/dpa3qlwgbrdxtrnup053gvwf27bsobt.mp3","text":"呼呼……（虎狼丸似乎在等待指令。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/bgkwke00ymb3w7p5x3ju1scgsopfvfl.mp3","text":"汪汪！（虎狼丸迅速到达了指定位置。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/odjjltzxss8zave8c7f2hz3p7wmeiyz.mp3","text":"汪……嗷！（虎狼丸的速度很快，不过及时停下来了。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/914dxr2im7v7bsg1w5u8qrcmuuphrbj.mp3","text":"咕噜噜噜……汪！！（虎狼丸召唤了人格面具！）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/pnpsoks425fv8cz39ui9rf0m1xdtbz7.mp3","text":"嗷呜——！（虎狼丸取得了先机！）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/agzutk121u7f8749jze8jt2invwopyg.mp3","text":"汪呜……汪！（虎狼丸攻向了敌人！）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/ppiyo1sy0q2kq4wktkde33j6abk6g5r.mp3","text":"汪——嗷！！（虎狼丸的气势震慑了敌人！）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/1nhgp1zolicp4v67ec2fqtc3nlv90gc.mp3","text":"汪呜……（虎狼丸敬佩地摇着尾巴。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/mogz8bbh5yl2940asr422toqn0bmfqm.mp3","text":"汪汪，汪！（虎狼丸很开心，但请小心不要被他扑倒。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/ka46e9rc8n1rca02wox6s9ynaho0e8e.mp3","text":"汪……汪汪！（虎狼丸对着逃走的敌人吠叫不止，似乎想去追赶。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/bizbg1phgbsttmu99gk7gqnmxvfb78y.mp3","text":"汪……嗷呜……汪汪！（虎狼丸挡住了敌人，不停大吠，听起来十分焦急。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/6zv01mrmlm3mdq9em0f60qsl75p6xme.mp3","text":"呼……（虎狼丸在地毯上打了个滚。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/jz5iy3cjuyug5ximmglhlwp6q0iuyau.mp3","text":"汪……！（虎狼丸开心地摇着尾巴，似乎很想一起玩耍。）","alt":"voice/char_4220_kormr/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/ghcl2sb9j1x22